  "keyFeatures": [
    "35 bundled pickaxe enchants with visual upgrade menu and per-enchant prestige",
    "Multiple custom economies (Tokens, Gems, and any custom currency) with Vault bridge",
    "Instant autosell with per-block prices and XP rewards",
    "Autominer clone that walks the mine wearing your skin",
    "Minions (zombie, pigman, villager) that mine independently",
    "13 floating-head pets with levels, boosts, and particle trails",
    "Socketable shards & runes with 13 effect types",
    "10-set boost armor unlock chain with live progress bars",
    "Loot chests with holograms, animations, and five bonus minigames",
    "Momentum combo multiplier with milestone celebrations",
    "Timed boosts for XP and economies (per-player or global)",
    "Top-10 leaderboards for blocks, XP, and every economy",
    "Fully data-driven: all features configurable via YAML with live reload",
    "Versioned auto-migrations with automatic backups",
    "PlaceholderAPI integration with full player/server stat exposure"
  ],
